# Ghostty adapter (TH-7c deliverable).
# This directory will be populated by the Phase 5 (TH-7c) commit:
#   - addon.json (mirroring iterm2/addon.json shape)
#   - adapter.mjs (Node stdio JSON-RPC peer; spawns osascript for the 4 ops)
#   - smoke.mjs (manual smoke for the Ghostty end-to-end)
#
# The .gitkeep ensures the directory persists in the tree so the
# bridge service's `cwd: "examples/sdk-demo/terminal-host/ghostty"`
# (Phase 4 / TH-7b) does not ENOENT before Phase 5 lands.
